    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-παυμα</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμπ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>repose, rest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μερμηράων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν ἄμπαυμα μεριμνέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					343
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Oxy.</u>
					9iii4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
					3iii14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>resting-place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.228
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Anyte</span>); of a tomb, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				4623
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Syria</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				453.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fallow land,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				115.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				112.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the state of such land,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀναπαύματι</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπαύμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					61a385
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1223.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1092.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>.</div>
